gantt
    title Field season
    dateFormat DD-MMM-YYYY
    excludes 09-Mar-2024
    section Survey
        Site walk    :done, walk, 04-Mar-2024, 3d
        Soil samples :active, soil, after walk, 4d
        Lab window   :lab, after soil, 5d
    section Report
        Draft        :draft, after lab, 3d
        Sign-off     :milestone, sign, after draft, 0d
